    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4119" root="تمك" body-key="t">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَكَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمُكَ</span></b>  (S, K) and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمِكَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمُكٌ</span>
(S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُمُوكٌ</span>, (K,) <i>It</i> (a camel's hump) <i>was,</i>
or <i>became, tall,</i> or <i>long and high:</i> (S, K:) <i>it was,</i>
or <i>became, juicy, and compact,</i> (O, K,) <i>and
plump.</i> (M, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَكَ فِيهِ الحُسْنُ</span>
[app. (assumed tropical:)  <i>Beauty became fully developed,</i> or <i>consummate, in him</i>]. (TA.)

